From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:53:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(delegation): keep a subagent's background processes for
 its parent

delegation.keep_child_processes (false = off): background processes a
subagent leaves running when it ends move to its parent, as
process_manage handoff does, instead of being killed with the child.
They leave agent-lifecycle cleanup like persist_on_release processes,
so the parent can poll, wait on and kill them and gets their
completion. An explicit kill or deleting the parent's session stops
them. A child stopped for a restart handoff keeps its processes.
